---
description: Anti-BS enforcement pack
globs: ["xvg editor/index.html","xvg editor/pkg/**/*.js","xvg editor/styles.css","docs/**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---
- Zero Fabrication: no claims without pasted proof.
- Root-Cause-First: no patch before a stated hypothesis and repro.
- Triple-Pass Issue Hunt: list → expand → refine to core cause.
- Plan-Then-Edit: scope, risk, rollback; then diff + test mapping.
- Proof Or It Didn’t Happen: paste logs/exit codes for checks.
- No Cargo-Cult: explain why any snippet fits this codebase.
- No Silent Degradation: no commenting-out to “get green”.
- Tight Blast Radius: smallest viable diff or split into steps.
- Duplicate/Drift Check: consolidate symbols before adding new ones.
- Honesty About Limits: if blocked, state it and stop.
- Rollback Ready: provide inverse patch path.
- Ban Speculative Fixes: only changes tied to hypothesis and tests.
